[
  {
    "content_id": "10022001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所罗门的歌，是歌中的雅歌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿他用口与我亲嘴； 因你的爱情比酒更美。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的膏油馨香； 你的名如同倒出来的香膏， 所以众童女都爱你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;愿你吸引我，我们就快跑跟随你。 王带我进了内室， 我们必因你欢喜快乐。 我们要称赞你的爱情， 胜似称赞美酒。 他们爱你是理所当然的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的众女子啊， 我虽然黑，却是秀美， 如同基达的帐棚， 好像所罗门的幔子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;不要因日头把我晒黑了就轻看我。 我同母的弟兄向我发怒， 他们使我看守葡萄园； 我自己的葡萄园却没有看守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我心所爱的啊，求你告诉我， 你在何处牧羊？ 晌午在何处使羊歇卧？ 我何必在你同伴的羊群旁边 好像蒙着脸的人呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你这女子中极美丽的， 你若不知道， 只管跟随羊群的脚踪去， 把你的山羊羔牧放在牧人帐棚的旁边。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶， 我将你比法老车上套的骏马。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你的两腮因发辫而秀美； 你的颈项因珠串而华丽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我们要为你编上金辫，镶上银钉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;王正坐席的时候， 我的哪哒香膏发出香味。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我以我的良人为一袋没药， 常在我怀中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我以我的良人为一棵凤仙花， 在隐·基底葡萄园中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶，你甚美丽！你甚美丽！ 你的眼好像鸽子眼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我的良人哪，你甚美丽可爱！ 我们以青草为床榻，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;以香柏树为房屋的栋梁， 以松树为椽子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是沙 的玫瑰花， 是谷中的百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶在女子中， 好像百合花在荆棘内。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在男子中， 如同苹果树在树林中。 我欢欢喜喜坐在他的荫下， 尝他果子的滋味，觉得甘甜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他带我入筵宴所， 以爱为旗在我以上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;求你们给我葡萄干增补我力， 给我苹果畅快我心， 因我思爱成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他的左手在我头下； 他的右手将我抱住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的众女子啊， 我指着羚羊或田野的母鹿嘱咐你们： 不要惊动、不要叫醒我所亲爱的， 等他自己情愿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;听啊！是我良人的声音； 看哪！他蹿山越岭而来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的良人好像羚羊，或像小鹿。 他站在我们墙壁后， 从窗户往里观看， 从窗棂往里窥探。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我良人对我说： 我的佳偶，我的美人， 起来，与我同去！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为冬天已往， 雨水止住过去了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;地上百花开放， 百鸟鸣叫的时候已经来到； 斑鸠的声音在我们境内也听见了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;无花果树的果子渐渐成熟； 葡萄树开花放香。 我的佳偶，我的美人， 起来，与我同去！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的鸽子啊，你在磐石穴中， 在陡岩的隐密处。 求你容我得见你的面貌， 得听你的声音； 因为你的声音柔和， 你的面貌秀美。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要给我们擒拿狐狸， 就是毁坏葡萄园的小狐狸， 因为我们的葡萄正在开花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;良人属我，我也属他； 他在百合花中牧放群羊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我的良人哪， 求你等到天起凉风、 日影飞去的时候， 你要转回，好像羚羊， 或像小鹿在比特山上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我夜间躺卧在床上， 寻找我心所爱的； 我寻找他，却寻不见。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我说：我要起来，游行城中， 在街市上，在宽阔处， 寻找我心所爱的。 我寻找他，却寻不见。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;城中巡逻看守的人遇见我； 我问他们：你们看见我心所爱的没有？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我刚离开他们就遇见我心所爱的。 我拉住他，不容他走， 领他入我母家， 到怀我者的内室。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的众女子啊， 我指着羚羊或田野的母鹿嘱咐你们： 不要惊动、不要叫醒我所亲爱的， 等他自己情愿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那从旷野上来、形状如烟柱、 以没药和乳香并商人各样香粉薰的是谁呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;看哪，是所罗门的轿； 四围有六十个勇士， 都是以色列中的勇士；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;手都持刀，善于争战， 腰间佩刀，防备夜间有惊慌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;所罗门王用黎巴嫩木 为自己制造一乘华轿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;轿柱是用银做的， 轿底是用金做的； 坐垫是紫色的， 其中所铺的乃耶路撒冷众女子的爱情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;锡安的众女子啊， 你们出去观看所罗门王！ 头戴冠冕，就是在他婚筵的日子、 心中喜乐的时候，他母亲给他戴上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶，你甚美丽！你甚美丽！ 你的眼在帕子内好像鸽子眼。 你的头发如同山羊群卧在基列山旁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齿如新剪毛的一群母羊， 洗净上来，个个都有双生， 没有一只丧掉子的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的唇好像一条朱红线； 你的嘴也秀美。 你的两太阳在帕子内， 如同一块石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的颈项好像大卫建造收藏军器的高台， 其上悬挂一千盾牌， 都是勇士的藤牌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的两乳好像百合花中吃草的一对小鹿， 就是母鹿双生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我要往没药山和乳香冈去， 直等到天起凉风、 日影飞去的时候回来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶，你全然美丽， 毫无瑕疵！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的新妇，求你与我一同离开黎巴嫩， 与我一同离开黎巴嫩。 从亚玛拿顶， 从示尼珥与黑门顶， 从有狮子的洞， 从有豹子的山往下观看。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我妹子，我新妇， 你夺了我的心。 你用眼一看， 用你项上的一条金链， 夺了我的心！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我妹子，我新妇， 你的爱情何其美！ 你的爱情比酒更美！ 你膏油的香气胜过一切香品！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我新妇，你的嘴唇滴蜜， 好像蜂房滴蜜； 你的舌下有蜜，有奶。 你衣服的香气如黎巴嫩的香气。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我妹子，我新妇， 乃是关锁的园， 禁闭的井，封闭的泉源。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你园内所种的结了石榴， 有佳美的果子， 并凤仙花与哪哒树。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;有哪哒和番红花， 菖蒲和桂树， 并各样乳香木、没药、沉香， 与一切上等的果品。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你是园中的泉，活水的井， 从黎巴嫩流下来的溪水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;北风啊，兴起！ 南风啊，吹来！ 吹在我的园内， 使其中的香气发出来。 愿我的良人进入自己园里， 吃他佳美的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我妹子，我新妇， 我进了我的园中， 采了我的没药和香料， 吃了我的蜜房和蜂蜜， 喝了我的酒和奶。 我的朋友们，请吃！ 我所亲爱的，请喝，且多多地喝！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我身睡卧，我心却醒。 这是我良人的声音； 他敲门说： 我的妹子，我的佳偶， 我的鸽子，我的完全人， 求你给我开门； 因我的头满了露水， 我的头发被夜露滴湿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我回答说： 我脱了衣裳，怎能再穿上呢？ 我洗了脚，怎能再玷污呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的良人从门孔里伸进手来， 我便因他动了心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我起来，要给我良人开门。 我的两手滴下没药； 我的指头有没药汁滴在门闩上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我给我的良人开了门； 我的良人却已转身走了。 他说话的时候，我神不守舍； 我寻找他，竟寻不见； 我呼叫他，他却不回答。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;城中巡逻看守的人遇见我， 打了我，伤了我； 看守城墙的人夺去我的披肩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的众女子啊，我嘱咐你们： 若遇见我的良人， 要告诉他，我因思爱成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你这女子中极美丽的， 你的良人比别人的良人有何强处？ 你的良人比别人的良人有何强处， 你就这样嘱咐我们？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的良人白而且红， 超乎万人之上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他的头像至精的金子； 他的头发厚密累垂，黑如乌鸦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他的眼如溪水旁的鸽子眼， 用奶洗净，安得合式。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他的两腮如香花畦， 如香草台； 他的嘴唇像百合花， 且滴下没药汁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他的两手好像金管， 镶嵌水苍玉； 他的身体如同雕刻的象牙， 周围镶嵌蓝宝石。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他的腿好像白玉石柱， 安在精金座上； 他的形状如黎巴嫩， 且佳美如香柏树。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他的口极其甘甜； 他全然可爱。 耶路撒冷的众女子啊， 这是我的良人； 这是我的朋友。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你这女子中极美丽的， 你的良人往何处去了？ 你的良人转向何处去了， 我们好与你同去寻找他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的良人下入自己园中， 到香花畦， 在园内牧放群羊， 采百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我属我的良人， 我的良人也属我； 他在百合花中牧放群羊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的佳偶啊，你美丽如得撒， 秀美如耶路撒冷， 威武如展开旌旗的军队。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;求你掉转眼目不看我， 因你的眼目使我惊乱。 你的头发如同山羊群卧在基列山旁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齿如一群母羊 洗净上来，个个都有双生， 没有一只丧掉子的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你的两太阳在帕子内， 如同一块石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;有六十王后八十妃嫔， 并有无数的童女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的鸽子，我的完全人， 只有这一个是她母亲独生的， 是生养她者所宝爱的。 众女子见了就称她有福； 王后妃嫔见了也赞美她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;那向外观看、如晨光发现、 美丽如月亮、皎洁如日头、 威武如展开旌旗军队的是谁呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我下入核桃园， 要看谷中青绿的植物， 要看葡萄发芽没有， 石榴开花没有。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不知不觉， 我的心将我安置在我尊长的车中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;回来，回来，书拉密女； 你回来，你回来，使我们得观看你。 你们为何要观看书拉密女， 像观看玛哈念跳舞的呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;王女啊，你的脚在鞋中何其美好！ 你的大腿圆润，好像美玉， 是巧匠的手做成的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的肚脐如圆杯， 不缺调和的酒； 你的腰如一堆麦子， 周围有百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的两乳好像一对小鹿， 就是母鹿双生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的颈项如象牙台； 你的眼目像希实本、巴特·拉并门旁的水池； 你的鼻子仿佛朝大马士革的黎巴嫩塔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的头在你身上好像迦密山； 你头上的发是紫黑色； 王的心因这下垂的发绺系住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我所爱的，你何其美好！ 何其可悦，使人欢畅喜乐！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你的身量好像棕树； 你的两乳如同其上的果子，累累下垂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我说：我要上这棕树，抓住枝子。 愿你的两乳好像葡萄累累下垂， 你鼻子的气味香如苹果；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你的口如上好的酒。 女子说：为我的良人下咽舒畅， 流入睡觉人的嘴中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我属我的良人， 他也恋慕我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我的良人，来吧！ 你我可以往田间去； 你我可以在村庄住宿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们早晨起来往葡萄园去， 看看葡萄发芽开花没有， 石榴放蕊没有； 我在那里要将我的爱情给你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;风茄放香， 在我们的门内有各样新陈佳美的果子； 我的良人，这都是我为你存留的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;巴不得你像我的兄弟， 像吃我母亲奶的兄弟； 我在外头遇见你就与你亲嘴， 谁也不轻看我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我必引导你， 领你进我母亲的家； 我可以领受教训， 也就使你喝石榴汁酿的香酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他的左手必在我头下； 他的右手必将我抱住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的众女子啊， 我嘱咐你们： 不要惊动、不要叫醒我所亲爱的， 等他自己情愿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那靠着良人从旷野上来的是谁呢？ 我在苹果树下叫醒你。 你母亲在那里为你劬劳； 生养你的在那里为你劬劳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;求你将我放在你心上如印记， 带在你臂上如戳记。 因为爱情如死之坚强， 嫉恨如阴间之残忍； 所发的电光是火焰的电光， 是耶和华的烈焰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;爱情，众水不能息灭， 大水也不能淹没。 若有人拿家中所有的财宝要换爱情， 就全被藐视。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我们有一小妹； 她的两乳尚未长成， 人来提亲的日子， 我们当为她怎样办理？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她若是墙， 我们要在其上建造银塔； 她若是门， 我们要用香柏木板围护她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我是墙； 我两乳像其上的楼。 那时，我在他眼中像得平安的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;所罗门在巴力·哈们有一葡萄园； 他将这葡萄园交给看守的人， 为其中的果子必交一千舍客勒银子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我自己的葡萄园在我面前。 所罗门哪，一千舍客勒归你， 二百舍客勒归看守果子的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你这住在园中的， 同伴都要听你的声音， 求你使我也得听见。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的良人哪，求你快来！ 如羚羊或小鹿在香草山上。</p>"
  }
]